{"id":"vendedor","lemma":"vendedor","pos":"noun","rank":2456,"glosses":["salesman"],"ipa":"/bendeˈdoɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"vendedores","feminine":"vendedora","femininePlural":"vendedoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-vendedor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy un vendedor.","en":"I'm a salesman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519609","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él también es un vendedor.","en":"He's a salesman too.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"also, too, as well"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Los vendedores suelen hablar rápido.","en":"Salesmen are usually fast talkers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687977","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"ground, land","l":"solar"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"rapid"}]},{"text":"Es difícil encontrar un buen vendedor.","en":"It's hard to find good salespeople.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"La vendedora no pudo abrir la caja registradora.","en":"The salesgirl couldn't open the cash register.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to open, open up"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"cash register"]]}]}